{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 23, :comments ["<b>That which you will bake, bake.</b> What you want to bake in the oven — bake it all today for two days; and what you need to cook from it in water — cook it today. The term אֲפִיָּה applies to bread, and the term בִּשּׁוּל to a cooked dish." "<b>For keeping.</b> For storage."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 16, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:52:42.650142563Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}